# App Router conventions

- Keep the 3-pane product UI: resume, jobs, chat + citations.
- `POST /api/chat` accepts `{ message, selectedJobId? }` and returns answer, citations, debug fields.
- `GET/POST /api/documents` is the session API. Uploads are multipart `kind` + `file`.
- Client components fetch those routes. Do not call Ollama or Gemini from the browser.
- Upload replace is one resume; jobs append with the next `job-N` id.
